            "SourceString": "By selecting \"I Acknowledge\", you confirm that you have read and understood the WARDOGS Privacy Policy. We collect and process certain personal data, including account information, gameplay activity, technical data and communications, to operate and improve the game, maintain security, prevent cheating and provide player support.  Your personal data will be handled in accordance with applicable data protection laws and our Privacy Policy, available at <link id=\"Privacy\" domain=\"www.wardogs.com\">https://www.wardogs.com/privacy</>",
            "LocalizedString": "By selecting \"I Acknowledge\", you confirm that you have read and understood the WARDOGS Privacy Policy. We collect and process certain personal data, including account information, gameplay activity, technical data and communications, to operate and improve the game, maintain security, prevent cheating and provide player support.  Your personal data will be handled in accordance with applicable data protection laws and our Privacy Policy, available at <link id=\"Privacy\" domain=\"www.wardogs.com\">https://www.wardogs.com/privacy</>"
